      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm just looking at the departures board now and it's just total chaos. people are everywhere, lines are huge, and it feels like everything is just breaking down. its actually kind of overwhelming how disorganized it is all of a sudden. any tips on how to cut through the noise and find a flight?",
